👋 Before You Start

This is my personal website. I built it myself, and I put a piece of me into it — my style, my ideas, and my experiences.

I shared it on GitHub because I love learning and sharing knowledge. But there are things that belong to me alone, and I hope they stay protected.

In short:

Code for learning, privacy for respect. 🩷

---

✅ You Are Free To

🧑‍💻 Code & Design

· Learn from the website's structure and UI design
· Reuse navigation or animation ideas
· Modify and improve the code for your own project
· Use it for personal, educational, or even commercial projects

📚 With just one condition:

· Credit the original source in your project's README

---

⛔ You May Not Use

🖼️ Personal Images

· My personal or family photos
· Any image that belongs to me or reveals information about me

✍️ Personal Content

· My Curriculum Vitae (CV)
· My personal and career experiences
· My biography or personal story
· Certificates, recommendations, or personal summaries

📊 Personal Data

· Contact details
· Academic and career history
· Anything that identifies me

---

💡 A Simple Tip

Before copying anything, ask yourself:

"Is this code? Or is this something that belongs to Esmail?"

· Code → Go ahead, take it and benefit 🎉
· Something personal → Please, don't 🙏

---

✉️ Need Something Special?

If you have a strong reason to use any of my personal content:

📧 Email me: esmailll.safwan@gmail.com

Tell me:

· Who you are
· Why you need it
· Where you'll use it

I'll reply — yes or no, always with respect ✌️

---

⚠️ If You Cross the Line

First time: A friendly message and a week to fix things.

If it repeats: I'll have to take legal action — and that's the last thing I want.

